        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2124, Rustic Modern Passage Mortise Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Rustic Modern Rectangular Passage Pocket Door Set comes packaged with two pulls--one for each side of the door--a mortise box with pop-out edge pull, and all the mounting hardware. It has a rustic modern appearance that makes it a great choice for almost any home renovation. Perfect for pocket doors, the Emtek made 2124 Rustic Modern Passage Mortise Pocket Door Hardware is installed by mortising it into the door.  It is made from sandcast bronze and is available in flat black, medium bronze, and tumble white bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Passage Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features two flush pulls and a mortise box with a built in finger edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/rustic-modern-rectangular-dummy-pocket-door-set-emtek-2126\"><b>Dummy Set</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/sandcast-bronze-rustic-modern-rectangular-privacy-pocket-door-set-emtek-2125\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/sandcast-bronze-rustic-modern-rectangular-keyed-entry-pocket-door-emtek-2123\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Passage Rustic Modern Rectangular Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Height: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2124-specifications.pdf?v=1704262402\"><b>Emtek 2124 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) rectangle flush pulls, a passage set mortise pull, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
